  "content": "<p>《遺物化鐵咒與法術書》</strong> 是一款〈鐵咒與法術書〉（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/irons-spells-n-spellbooks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks</strong></a>）與〈遺物〉（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/relics-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Relics</strong></a>）模組的橋樑擴充模組，在遊戲中加入了多種獨特的遺物。每件遺物皆運用了《鐵咒與法術書》的不同機制，釋放其完整潛力，並提升遊戲體驗。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/82Gbunq.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"615\" height=\"100\"></p><p>必要依賴：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/relics-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">遺物模組（RELICS）</a></li>\n<li><a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/irons-spells-n-spellbooks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">鐵咒與法術書（IRON'S SPELLS 'N SPELLBOOKS）</a></li>\n</ul><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4lbEmSA.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"474\" height=\"100\"></p><ul>\n<li><strong>1.21.X：</strong> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/reliquified-irons-spells-n-spellbooks/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20&amp;version=1.21.1&amp;gameVersionTypeId=6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">NEOFORGE 版本</a></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ggCi2k8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"193\" height=\"100\"></p><p><strong>問：我可以在哪裡找到這個模組中的遺物？</strong><br>答：所有遺物都會出現在《鐵咒與法術書》或其擴充模組所新增的任何結構中。</p><p><strong>問：我可以在整合包中使用這個模組嗎？</strong><br>答：可以，歡迎隨意加入。</p><p><strong>問：我可以將這個模組重新發布到其他資源網站嗎？</strong><br>答：不可以。</p><div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><hr></div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/pHren9yxzW\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/gG6f4t0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Octo-Studios/reliquified-irons-spells-n-spellbooks\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sK6KJcQ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252freliquified-irons-spells-n-spellbooks\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OYN08d0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fcgi-bin%252fwebscr%253freturn%253dhttps%253a%252f%252flegacy.curseforge.com%252fprojects%252f1196449%2526cn%253dAdd%2bspecial%2binstructions%2bto%2bthe%2baddon%2bauthor()%2526business%253dp%2540foxy.cat%2526bn%253dPP-DonationsBF%253abtn_donateCC_LG.gif%253aNonHosted%2526cancel_return%253dhttps%253a%252f%252flegacy.curseforge.com%252fprojects%252f1196449%2526lc%253dUS%2526item_name%253dReliquified%2bArs%2bNouveau%2b(from%2bcurseforge.com)%2526cmd%253d_donations%2526rm%253d1%2526no_shipping%253d1%2526currency_code%253dUSD\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fPIlVls.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a></div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>想試試我們的其他模組嗎？請造訪 <span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><a style=\"color:#b96ad9\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252focto-studios.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">SHATTERBYTE.COM</a></span> 了解更多資訊！</strong></p>\n</div>",
